config IIO_TA1618_SC2720_AUXADC
	bool "Nokia TA-1618 SC2720 AUXADC"
	depends on MACH_NOKIA_TA1618
	depends on IIO
	help
	  Direct raw AUXADC readings for channels 0, 1, 2, 4 and 14 on the
	  Nokia 3210 4G TA-1618. The provider performs one bounded conversion
	  per read and does not configure interrupts, buffers, triggers or
	  persistent ADC state.
